---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us">
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-24">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-8">About RMG Technologies</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg text-slate-400">
			<p class="mb-6">
				RMG TECHNOLOGIES INC was founded on a simple principle: software should be built for high stakes. Whether it's a financial trading algorithm executing in milliseconds, or a defense system that absolutely cannot fail, we engineer for reliability.
			</p>
			<p class="mb-6">
				We do not build bloated software. We build lean, secure, and fast applications. From complex military-grade systems to the day-to-day tools that keep modern businesses running, our baseline is always the same: it must work.
			</p>
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Our Philosophy</h2>
			<p>
				We believe that the best technology is the technology you don't have to think about. It just works.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>